OL,3,GNEWSAWhy hotter summers are making
OL,4,ABritish potatoes smaller
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the roller shutter door opens to
OL,7,Freveal one of Tim Rooke's potato
OL,8,Fstores, the harvest looks impressive.
OL,9,FSeven hundred tonnes are kept in this
OL,10,Fbuilding alone, ready to be turned into
OL,11,Fcrisps.
OL,13,FYet North Yorkshire farmer Rooke is far
OL,14,Ffrom happy. He plucks a large potato
OL,15,Ffrom the pile and in his other hand,
OL,16,Fplaces two much smaller ones.
OL,18,F"We've probably lost two tonnes on
OL,19,Fevery fifty tonnes in here, potatoes
OL,20,Fthat have just fallen through the
OL,21,Fgraders because they are far too
OL,22,Fsmall."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
