OL,3,GNEWSAWhy hotter summers are making
OL,4,ABritish potatoes smaller
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prolonged dry spell this summer
OL,7,Fmeant his crop was beginning to die. He
OL,8,Fwas forced to harvest early, but that
OL,9,Fmeant his potatoes hadn't grown to the
OL,10,Fsize his customers want.
